  ('98aa95a8-7e43-73cf-09bc-03e19cee1fdc'::uuid, '3c27a16f-0942-b68a-c909-1a8798bdfe08'::uuid, 3, 'multiple_choice', 'medium', 1, 'Why write "Action Titles" above financial charts and tables?', '', '["They decorate slide headers","They tell busy readers the central insight immediately rather than naming raw variables","They hide data variances"]'::jsonb, 1, '{}'::jsonb, 'Insight-driven titles convert charts from raw displays into strategic takeaways.'),
  ('c6cc5a2b-173c-7e12-15d2-e615f3d65874'::uuid, '3c27a16f-0942-b68a-c909-1a8798bdfe08'::uuid, 4, 'scenario', 'hard', 1, 'Why should abstract "trailer" summaries be avoided on page one?', '', '["They tease what the memo explores without delivering actual conclusions or numbers","They are too technical","They use too many charts"]'::jsonb, 0, '{}'::jsonb, 'Executives expect standalone answers on page one—not previews of answers to come.'),
  ('4669e444-8f13-ad95-86da-308cc40aeebc'::uuid, '7997666d-b28a-851a-4405-2fda39a7c5d7'::uuid, 1, 'multiple_choice', 'medium', 1, 'Under the Pyramid Principle, how do top-level subheadings relate to the governing thesis?', '', '["They tell an unrelated background anecdote","They summarize 3–4 grouped pillars that logically prove the top conclusion","They list steps chronologically"]'::jsonb, 1, '{}'::jsonb, 'Reading only the main claim plus level-1 pillars should present a complete coherent argument.'),
  ('d34b7889-02e0-0082-31c0-3d6eee3d64c7'::uuid, '7997666d-b28a-851a-4405-2fda39a7c5d7'::uuid, 2, 'scenario', 'medium', 1, 'How should business proposals present uncertain future ROI?', '', '["Promise single exact best-case projections as certainty","State unit assumptions transparently alongside conservative downside break-even bounds","Remove financial estimates completely"]'::jsonb, 1, '{}'::jsonb, 'Visible assumptions and conservative break-even limits earn leadership trust.'),
  ('0c9b06c9-b043-5071-a77e-5dd09afc04a2'::uuid, '7997666d-b28a-851a-4405-2fda39a7c5d7'::uuid, 3, 'multiple_choice', 'medium', 1, 'Which email closing clears executive approvals fastest?', '', '["\"Thoughts appreciated whenever!\"","\"Reply Approved to confirm Option B ($3.2k, launch Nov 18) by Thu 3 PM.\"","\"See attached 8-page draft.\""]'::jsonb, 1, '{}'::jsonb, 'Bounded action asks minimize cognitive friction in busy inboxes.'),
  ('72ae82be-0be5-6301-4154-a1c5cf2a9276'::uuid, '7997666d-b28a-851a-4405-2fda39a7c5d7'::uuid, 4, 'scenario', 'hard', 1, 'What is the purpose of Red-Teaming your business brief prior to submission?', '', '["Deleting financial metrics","Pre-identifying tough stakeholder objections and embedding factual mitigations","Adding complex jargon"]'::jsonb, 1, '{}'::jsonb, 'Pre-answering skeptical questions keeps executive review focused on decision-making.'),
  ('bb4701c9-9fb9-34c3-bab4-d0837a84b1cc'::uuid, '7997666d-b28a-851a-4405-2fda39a7c5d7'::uuid, 5, 'multiple_choice', 'hard', 1, 'What does a Numeric Reconciliation Scan catch before submission?', '', '["Font color shifts","Contradictions between summary figures, prose claims, and source tables","Comma frequency"]'::jsonb, 1, '{}'::jsonb, 'Aligning numbers across summary, charts, and tables protects data credibility.'),
  ('026868be-dfb5-ea3c-ca09-8eb5b0a89ecd'::uuid, '4d6bdf66-09e7-e597-142d-7bc07cdca651'::uuid, 1, 'multiple_choice', 'medium', 1, 'What defines "showing" rather than purely "telling" inside fiction?', '', '["Adding four synonyms per noun","Rendering physical actions, concrete details, and speech so readers infer emotion","Avoiding character flaws"]'::jsonb, 1, '{}'::jsonb, 'Concrete behavioral and sensory cues let readers feel scenes firsthand.'),
  ('bf708f3b-2da8-6c97-859b-a60aea6f75a5'::uuid, '4d6bdf66-09e7-e597-142d-7bc07cdca651'::uuid, 2, 'scenario', 'medium', 1, 'What is "head-hopping" in narrative point of view?', '', '["Writing action scenes quickly","Shifting abruptly between different characters’ private thoughts inside one continuous scene","Using short chapters"]'::jsonb, 1, '{}'::jsonb, 'Mixing inner thoughts mid-scene breaks Limited POV immersion cleanly.'),
  ('6aa9c36c-e908-f2b9-66f1-a104e4dd53f4'::uuid, '4d6bdf66-09e7-e597-142d-7bc07cdca651'::uuid, 3, 'multiple_choice', 'medium', 1, 'What makes an antagonist compelling rather than cartoonish?', '', '["Unexplained pure hatred","Logically coherent competing goals clashing against the protagonist’s stakes","Long monologues"]'::jsonb, 1, '{}'::jsonb, 'Understandable human motives raise authentic tension across scenes.'),
  ('507c1372-bd62-4743-1aab-20ba99137b46'::uuid, '4d6bdf66-09e7-e597-142d-7bc07cdca651'::uuid, 4, 'scenario', 'hard', 1, 'What distinguishes dialogue subtext from on-the-nose speech?', '', '["Characters speak loudly","Characters convey tension through indirect deflection and mundane topics instead of blunt speeches","Removing punctuation"]'::jsonb, 1, '{}'::jsonb, 'Real emotional friction rarely explains itself literally word for word.'),
  ('453429d7-1768-3d55-5b0e-0f6dd0b4797f'::uuid, '9c6869d6-13fd-09d1-6180-8b556c7dcb2a'::uuid, 1, 'multiple_choice', 'medium', 1, 'What proves a scene actually earns its pages in a story draft?', '', '["Accurate room layout descriptions","Conditions, stakes, or relationships visibly turn between entry and exit","Ten lines of dialogue"]'::jsonb, 1, '{}'::jsonb, 'Meaningful turns ensure every scene advances story stakes rather than pausing motion.'),
  ('44763dc7-c00a-609a-a613-2f24216f269b'::uuid, '9c6869d6-13fd-09d1-6180-8b556c7dcb2a'::uuid, 2, 'scenario', 'medium', 1, 'Which rewrite removes filter-word distance cleanly?', '', '["She felt cold air brush her neck.","Cold air brushed her neck.","She noticed it was feeling colder behind her."]'::jsonb, 1, '{}'::jsonb, 'Cutting "she felt" drops readers straight inside physical sensation.'),
  ('84843997-4cac-414e-c2d7-9a5382674be2'::uuid, '9c6869d6-13fd-09d1-6180-8b556c7dcb2a'::uuid, 3, 'multiple_choice', 'medium', 1, 'Why can a convenient outside rescue weaken a story climax?', '', '["It adds action","It strips protagonists of earned agency and skirts resolving their central flaw","It shortens pages"]'::jsonb, 1, '{}'::jsonb, 'Satisfying climaxes force characters to make hard, decisive choices.'),
  ('0f9cbf70-7b07-aca9-098c-237ce705f27e'::uuid, '9c6869d6-13fd-09d1-6180-8b556c7dcb2a'::uuid, 4, 'scenario', 'hard', 1, 'How do writers intentionally accelerate fast action pacing?', '', '["Long descriptive weather pauses","Tight syntax pairing active verbs with pared-back modifiers","Head-hopping"]'::jsonb, 1, '{}'::jsonb, 'Spare, concrete phrasing speeds eye movement alongside physical urgency.'),
  ('763fe586-8b03-fc89-ccde-fdbc6dc87b94'::uuid, '9c6869d6-13fd-09d1-6180-8b556c7dcb2a'::uuid, 5, 'multiple_choice', 'hard', 1, 'Why save cut scenes in a separate "Outtakes" file during macro revision?', '', '["To inflate word count","Removing deletion fear helps writers trim sluggish warm-up pages bravely","To reuse as footnotes"]'::jsonb, 1, '{}'::jsonb, 'Safe archival reduces emotional reluctance when testing bolder structural cuts.'),
  ('e0e481b9-77a7-0d96-cab8-15804b783ca6'::uuid, '25e49cad-162b-b7ca-9fc4-28710d9def00'::uuid, 1, 'multiple_choice', 'medium', 1, 'What two connectors drive causal momentum in great storytelling instead of "and then"?', '', '["Meanwhile and also","\"But\" (complication) and \"Therefore\" (consequence)","Furthermore and additionally"]'::jsonb, 1, '{}'::jsonb, 'Causal obstacles and responses create suspense where pure sequences stall.'),
  ('42be570a-f7bb-e578-0180-1c400294e6b9'::uuid, '25e49cad-162b-b7ca-9fc4-28710d9def00'::uuid, 2, 'scenario', 'medium', 1, 'Why center an applied story around one specific customer or peer instead of "thousands of users"?', '', '["Numbers are confusing","Individual human stories evoke immediate empathy that abstract aggregates cannot trigger alone","It omits research"]'::jsonb, 1, '{}'::jsonb, 'Personal specificity engages reader care before broad proof scales urgency.'),
  ('c7b98b47-f82b-210a-f03c-eaac27262a65'::uuid, '25e49cad-162b-b7ca-9fc4-28710d9def00'::uuid, 3, 'multiple_choice', 'medium', 1, 'In the 5-Beat Applied Arc, why avoid skipping Beat 3 (initial struggle)?', '', '["Instant frictionless triumphs sound artificial and untrustworthy","Struggle fills empty time","Audiences dislike wins"]'::jsonb, 0, '{}'::jsonb, 'Real obstacles prove the turning insight was genuinely tested and earned.'),
  ('a2f92399-7ade-6b97-6333-06f17aac760b'::uuid, '25e49cad-162b-b7ca-9fc4-28710d9def00'::uuid, 4, 'scenario', 'hard', 1, 'How does the Accordion Story Method work across varying time slots?', '', '["Invent brand-new unrelated characters","Hold the core 4-part causal spine constant while scaling descriptive snapshots up or down","Speak twice as fast"]'::jsonb, 1, '{}'::jsonb, 'An intact spine ensures even a 60-second version lands complete meaning.'),
  ('8cc77ab9-3995-e0c5-8fe6-8f36f18967d0'::uuid, '6ee59cbc-8e06-f4ef-ef3a-6b41878310e5'::uuid, 1, 'multiple_choice', 'medium', 1, 'Where do numbers perform strongest inside an applied narrative?', '', '["Stacked six-deep in sentence one","Sparingly right after story stakes make readers care why the metric matters","Omitted completely"]'::jsonb, 1, '{}'::jsonb, 'Story generates care; focused metrics then establish broader scale cleanly.'),
  ('8566b000-abd8-a977-5845-c44428a67c4c'::uuid, '6ee59cbc-8e06-f4ef-ef3a-6b41878310e5'::uuid, 2, 'scenario', 'medium', 1, 'What breaks audience immersion during slide-accompanied live storytelling?', '', '["Full-bleed visual photos","Projecting complete verbatim story paragraphs behind you while reading them","Single crisp quotes"]'::jsonb, 1, '{}'::jsonb, 'Visual text walls pull eyes into fast silent reading while ears tune out voice.'),
  ('d842e975-af78-6bff-24cc-90348be5f716'::uuid, '6ee59cbc-8e06-f4ef-ef3a-6b41878310e5'::uuid, 3, 'multiple_choice', 'medium', 1, 'Which practice preserves ethical storytelling credibility?', '', '["Crafting fictional dramatic quotes for clarity","Obtaining informed consent, honoring verified facts, and crediting partners fairly","Framing subjects as helpless"]'::jsonb, 1, '{}'::jsonb, 'Truth, consent, and dignified attribution earn lasting audience trust.'),
  ('0ef137ed-18f9-bf51-01cf-669d021fc2cb'::uuid, '6ee59cbc-8e06-f4ef-ef3a-6b41878310e5'::uuid, 4, 'scenario', 'hard', 1, 'How do you deliver a story lesson cleanly without sounding preachy?', '', '["End with a firm command exclamation","Share the concrete habit shift you adopted and invite listeners gently","Repeat morals twice"]'::jsonb, 1, '{}'::jsonb, 'Modeling personal change builds practical adoption without triggering resistance.'),
  ('8b1c0b0d-e2a5-193e-4e6f-be92979eca1c'::uuid, '6ee59cbc-8e06-f4ef-ef3a-6b41878310e5'::uuid, 5, 'multiple_choice', 'hard', 1, 'What vocal move maximizes impact right after delivering a story’s pivotal reveal?', '', '["Skipping directly into appendix metrics","Holding a calm 1–2 second silent pause","Clearing notes hastily"]'::jsonb, 1, '{}'::jsonb, 'Silence creates space for listeners to register emotional weight fully.'),
  ('7ff11295-54b7-47d2-8fe4-18332a4b90a2'::uuid, '5f4e52a9-5e36-e9d8-4f08-1c4a39c06f54'::uuid, 1, 'multiple_choice', 'medium', 1, 'What is the core objective of the "So What?" test in copywriting?', '', '["Making sentences longer","Converting dry internal product specs into concrete buyer time, cost, or stress relief","Removing brand names"]'::jsonb, 1, '{}'::jsonb, 'Buyers buy improved outcomes—not uncontextualized technical specifications.'),
  ('a7291695-b4fe-aa5f-42cb-44cf545e9211'::uuid, '5f4e52a9-5e36-e9d8-4f08-1c4a39c06f54'::uuid, 2, 'scenario', 'medium', 1, 'Why use Voice-of-Customer (VoC) phrases lifted from reviews and support logs?', '', '["It eliminates editing passes","Buyers recognize their own real words and feel understood immediately","It hides pricing"]'::jsonb, 1, '{}'::jsonb, 'Exact buyer phrasing cuts guesswork and aligns effortlessly with audience pain.'),
  ('10ff3828-2373-b784-3293-0f7440c6706c'::uuid, '5f4e52a9-5e36-e9d8-4f08-1c4a39c06f54'::uuid, 3, 'multiple_choice', 'medium', 1, 'What should reading only a landing page’s H1 and H2 subheads top-to-bottom accomplish?', '', '["Sound mysterious and vague","Communicate the full logical pitch (problem, solution, proof, CTA) standalone","List company team bios"]'::jsonb, 1, '{}'::jsonb, 'A strong subhead spine captures attention from fast skimmers cleanly.'),
  ('26a9e527-1580-9282-5c85-c426828365c3'::uuid, '5f4e52a9-5e36-e9d8-4f08-1c4a39c06f54'::uuid, 4, 'scenario', 'hard', 1, 'Which CTA button microcopy creates clearest expectation at click time?', '', '["Submit","Get My Free 5-Minute Audit Guide","Click Here"]'::jsonb, 1, '{}'::jsonb, 'Reward-focused CTAs state exact next value clearly rather than sounding robotic.'),
  ('33f67bd6-bc8a-01d7-55c4-719b377d1788'::uuid, 'df98ca11-f907-8d7c-45c3-70ed2a934803'::uuid, 1, 'multiple_choice', 'medium', 1, 'In the PAS framework, what differentiates thoughtful "Agitation" from cheap panic hype?', '', '["Bright red countdown clocks","Highlighting realistic daily costs of inaction calmly without fear-mongering","Insulting users for past tools"]'::jsonb, 1, '{}'::jsonb, 'Respectful depiction of status-quo pain creates natural urgency ethically.'),
  ('c7be2a47-1413-85c0-dbaa-b23041fc7be5'::uuid, 'df98ca11-f907-8d7c-45c3-70ed2a934803'::uuid, 2, 'scenario', 'medium', 1, 'Why place brief risk-reversal text ("No credit card needed / Cancel anytime") right beside CTA buttons?', '', '["To save legal space","To disarm last-second checkout fear right at the exact point of hesitation","To lengthen the footer"]'::jsonb, 1, '{}'::jsonb, 'Reassurance belongs right next to commitment friction—not hidden far below.'),
  ('8d7e6ae2-51b3-071d-579a-2f2baeeae4ee'::uuid, 'df98ca11-f907-8d7c-45c3-70ed2a934803'::uuid, 3, 'multiple_choice', 'medium', 1, 'What causes rapid bounce rates right after clicking a high-performing social ad?', '', '["Simple hero layouts","Message mismatch between the ad’s specific promise and the landing page headline","Clean risk reversal"]'::jsonb, 1, '{}'::jsonb, 'Continuity between ad promise and landing H1 keeps visitors oriented and confident.'),
  ('35262a4c-064a-5fe1-de82-c88b2613d3c6'::uuid, 'df98ca11-f907-8d7c-45c3-70ed2a934803'::uuid, 4, 'scenario', 'hard', 1, 'Which social-proof quote converts skeptical prospects best?', '', '["\"Best service ever!\" — J.M.","A real quote voicing pre-buy hesitation, specific outcome gain, and verifiable role","An anonymous 5-star badge"]'::jsonb, 1, '{}'::jsonb, 'Specific skepticism-to-result proof mirrors how cautious buyers genuinely evaluate offers.'),
  ('d190a82f-14e7-f0a7-da79-b34a605442d2'::uuid, 'df98ca11-f907-8d7c-45c3-70ed2a934803'::uuid, 5, 'multiple_choice', 'hard', 1, 'What defines a high-signal conversion copy hypothesis?', '', '["Changing word order randomly to see what clicks","Linking a targeted messaging shift to a clear behavioral metric and VoC insight","Testing five font families simultaneously"]'::jsonb, 1, '{}'::jsonb, 'Research-anchored hypotheses clarify why a change succeeded or failed cleanly.'),
  ('df203d6c-803c-ce67-6d44-5638522353ce'::uuid, '3fc01fb4-f25f-25b9-66f9-264abe3183f1'::uuid, 1, 'multiple_choice', 'medium', 1, 'Under the Diataxis model, what defines a Technical Tutorial vs. a Reference manual?', '', '["Tutorials guide hands-on learning safely end-to-end; Reference provides neutral factual parameter lookup specs","Reference includes conversational stories","Tutorials skip environment setup"]'::jsonb, 0, '{}'::jsonb, 'Separating guided learning from factual reference prevents cluttering either audience.'),
  ('6de8e7fc-6eae-d7ee-c132-7dc3085c677c'::uuid, '3fc01fb4-f25f-25b9-66f9-264abe3183f1'::uuid, 2, 'scenario', 'medium', 1, 'Why place UI panel location BEFORE the action command ("In Settings > Keys, click Rotate")?', '', '["Shorter sentences","Users visually locate the control region before scanning for the button verb","Avoids bold styling"]'::jsonb, 1, '{}'::jsonb, 'Location-first phrasing stops readers from backtracking across sentences.'),
  ('e949ff97-e96c-03f9-1787-a50ba9737f81'::uuid, '3fc01fb4-f25f-25b9-66f9-264abe3183f1'::uuid, 3, 'multiple_choice', 'medium', 1, 'What breaks developers most frequently when copying JSON code snippets from web docs?', '', '["Indentation spaces","Non-standard JS-style comments (`// ...`) or `...` ellipses placed inside raw JSON payloads","Bearer auth headers"]'::jsonb, 1, '{}'::jsonb, 'Strict JSON parsers choke immediately on non-standard comment lines inside copyable examples.'),
  ('9dd0f597-692c-a03d-77b4-e753b9eaf0ee'::uuid, '3fc01fb4-f25f-25b9-66f9-264abe3183f1'::uuid, 4, 'scenario', 'hard', 1, 'Why state exact prerequisites (runtime versions, account permissions) before Step 1?', '', '["Pushes readers back","Prevents silent environment crashes halfway through installation tutorials","Replaces troubleshooting sections"]'::jsonb, 1, '{}'::jsonb, 'Explicit upfront state verification isolates environment friction immediately.'),
  ('a0672940-d5d9-2d5c-ebde-4fafa943a3cc'::uuid, '44eab085-12b9-bee2-1602-7331d7901b5c'::uuid, 1, 'multiple_choice', 'medium', 1, 'When should technical writers convert narrative prose into a structured decision table?', '', '["Never—prose always wins","Whenever explaining multi-role permissions, config flags, or nested conditional rules","Only for marketing sales copy"]'::jsonb, 1, '{}'::jsonb, 'Tables reveal rule boundaries instantaneously where conditional prose snarls comprehension.'),
  ('af89311d-39d3-66d0-3ed1-2f645773dce9'::uuid, '44eab085-12b9-bee2-1602-7331d7901b5c'::uuid, 2, 'scenario', 'medium', 1, 'Which tense & pronoun standard improves global developer clarity most cleanly?', '', '["Future tense (\"the API will output\") plus vague \"it/this\"","Active simple present tense plus exact repeated component nouns","Casual regional idioms"]'::jsonb, 1, '{}'::jsonb, 'Present tense matches deterministic system rules and eliminates translation friction.'),
  ('19aa9575-5da4-ad31-f262-6004f29a4629'::uuid, '44eab085-12b9-bee2-1602-7331d7901b5c'::uuid, 3, 'multiple_choice', 'medium', 1, 'What should appear right at the top of product release notes?', '', '["Team holiday greetings","Breaking changes requiring user migration paired with deadlines and old-vs-new diffs","Internal refactor commit IDs"]'::jsonb, 1, '{}'::jsonb, 'Immediate breaking-change flags prevent silent production integration breakage.'),
  ('0da9967a-d85b-c3ae-8c24-c26f72214740'::uuid, '44eab085-12b9-bee2-1602-7331d7901b5c'::uuid, 4, 'scenario', 'hard', 1, 'What core problem does a Docs-as-Code Pull Request workflow prevent?', '', '["Long build logs","Documentation drifting months behind evolving code behavior","Use of bullet lists"]'::jsonb, 1, '{}'::jsonb, 'Reviewing docs inside the same PR as code changes enforces synchronous accuracy.'),
  ('2f7f7369-9dfa-9479-fe02-731d5695a50f'::uuid, '44eab085-12b9-bee2-1602-7331d7901b5c'::uuid, 5, 'multiple_choice', 'hard', 1, 'Which metric gives high-clarity evidence of missing docs or wrong terminology?', '', '["High homepage bounce","Top zero-result help search queries paired with repetitive support tickets on one workflow","Fast server ping"]'::jsonb, 1, '{}'::jsonb, 'Failed searches directly reveal user vocabulary mismatches and unaddressed confusion points.'),
  ('3e40c935-8486-a88d-51bf-4d36b1156d56'::uuid, 'b78d1b95-6df5-bfd0-d558-5eb3c517bddc'::uuid, 1, 'multiple_choice', 'medium', 1, 'What distinguishes an academic thesis from a plain factual topic statement?', '', '["Longer bibliography","Making a contestable interpretive, comparative, or causal claim bounded cleanly in scope","Avoiding counter-perspectives"]'::jsonb, 1, '{}'::jsonb, 'Theses assert arguable relationships requiring structured evidence rather than consensus facts.'),
  ('75e9f230-e838-030c-5fd4-f1df7093e885'::uuid, 'b78d1b95-6df5-bfd0-d558-5eb3c517bddc'::uuid, 2, 'scenario', 'medium', 1, 'How should a thematic literature review organize cited sources?', '', '["Alphabetically one summary paragraph per author","Around shared analytical concepts, variables, and points of scholarly agreement/conflict","Strictly by publication year"]'::jsonb, 1, '{}'::jsonb, 'Synthesizing authors around thematic ideas exposes scholarly conversations cleanly.'),
  ('7926936e-f274-442e-134c-06669fab3bc7'::uuid, 'b78d1b95-6df5-bfd0-d558-5eb3c517bddc'::uuid, 3, 'multiple_choice', 'medium', 1, 'In MEAL paragraph design, what follows right after citing evidence?', '', '["Immediate transition to a brand new topic","Explicit Analysis explaining how or why that cited finding supports or nuances the paragraph claim","Three decorative adjectives"]'::jsonb, 1, '{}'::jsonb, 'Your analysis supplies the intellectual connective tissue turning citations into arguments.'),
  ('060653d3-a3bf-a3cb-fcd5-0f4d75281773'::uuid, 'b78d1b95-6df5-bfd0-d558-5eb3c517bddc'::uuid, 4, 'scenario', 'hard', 1, 'What defines academic "patchwriting"?', '', '["Citing two journals simultaneously","Keeping original sentence structure while merely swapping out scattered synonyms—still compromising originality","Paraphrasing from clear memory with attribution"]'::jsonb, 1, '{}'::jsonb, 'True paraphrasing reconstructs understood concepts naturally in original syntax plus citation.'),
  ('9da32bfa-8e0d-dc84-6284-f154311bfbf3'::uuid, '09bc2764-88b1-2c2c-e6ee-5dd7c6f1ea05'::uuid, 1, 'multiple_choice', 'medium', 1, 'Why favor calibrated hedges ("findings indicate within urban clinics") over absolute boasts ("proves globally")?', '', '["Weakness in writing style","Matches claim certainty proportionally to study sample, design limits, and validity bounds","Increases citation marks"]'::jsonb, 1, '{}'::jsonb, 'Scholarly integrity demands matching linguistic certainty carefully to evidential strength.'),
  ('e93e86f3-9651-4696-52c1-2ec3b558fe20'::uuid, '09bc2764-88b1-2c2c-e6ee-5dd7c6f1ea05'::uuid, 2, 'scenario', 'medium', 1, 'What makes "steelmanning" counterarguments effective in academic prose?', '', '["Attacking weakest outlier claims loudly","Engaging strongest credible objections fairly before showing why your synthesis still clarifies reality","Omitting opposing studies"]'::jsonb, 1, '{}'::jsonb, 'Addressing strongest counter-evidence proves deep command of surrounding scholarship.'),
  ('82968ce4-370b-d229-5225-0c289d6673f4'::uuid, '09bc2764-88b1-2c2c-e6ee-5dd7c6f1ea05'::uuid, 3, 'multiple_choice', 'medium', 1, 'Which approach balances active and passive voice cleanly across research papers?', '', '["100% passive throughout","Active voice for claims and author attribution; selective passive where methodological procedures remain central","Avoid pronouns and verbs"]'::jsonb, 1, '{}'::jsonb, 'Purposeful voice keeps analytical reasoning dynamic while maintaining clean methods reporting.'),
  ('84ed776d-8d5d-90bf-fc1b-962a101133ce'::uuid, '09bc2764-88b1-2c2c-e6ee-5dd7c6f1ea05'::uuid, 4, 'scenario', 'hard', 1, 'What does a bi-directional reference audit verify before submission?', '', '["Font style consistency","100% parity between every in-text citation and complete bibliography metadata entries","Word counts per abstract"]'::jsonb, 1, '{}'::jsonb, 'Clean one-to-one mapping protects transparent traceability across all sources.'),
  ('3d6384b6-14fc-f3a3-5709-62f722270139'::uuid, '09bc2764-88b1-2c2c-e6ee-5dd7c6f1ea05'::uuid, 5, 'multiple_choice', 'hard', 1, 'What gap does a post-draft Reverse Outline reveal rapidly?', '', '["Misplaced apostrophes","Body paragraphs drifting off the opening thesis, duplicated themes, or weak logical jumps","Margin errors"]'::jsonb, 1, '{}'::jsonb, 'Extracting paragraph claims exposes macro structure imbalances hidden during line drafting.'),
  ('d3ec412c-4f8e-739d-b48b-cf2a5023db69'::uuid, '30b2715f-4dca-4e97-c9d8-05c61ee7336e'::uuid, 1, 'multiple_choice', 'medium', 1, 'Why layer analytical reports into Executive Summary, Main Findings, and Appendices?', '', '["Increases ink usage","Serves executive scanners quickly while keeping raw evidence verifiable without clogging main narrative","Eliminates page breaks"]'::jsonb, 1, '{}'::jsonb, 'Tiered architecture satisfies both hurried leaders and detail-checking specialists smoothly.'),
  ('34b1b022-1aeb-6f05-e266-014f693bb19c'::uuid, '30b2715f-4dca-4e97-c9d8-05c61ee7336e'::uuid, 2, 'scenario', 'medium', 1, 'Why always report raw counts (`n = ...`) beside report percentages?', '', '["Makes text longer","Prevents tiny-sample spikes from looking artificially huge and shows statistical weight transparently","Replaces titles"]'::jsonb, 1, '{}'::jsonb, 'Showing denominators anchors percentage changes in honest sample context.'),
  ('5fc4bd3c-208b-c9d2-ad0a-bc66ce4c20b1'::uuid, '30b2715f-4dca-4e97-c9d8-05c61ee7336e'::uuid, 3, 'multiple_choice', 'medium', 1, 'What core rule protects analytical trust between Findings and Recommendations?', '', '["Mixing blame opinions into data logs","Separating impartial verified Findings strictly from traceable proposed Recommendations","Skipping methodology descriptions"]'::jsonb, 1, '{}'::jsonb, 'Objective evidence stays uncontested when separated cleanly from action debates.'),
  ('197eb15a-6e92-1723-83b9-845d46174fb7'::uuid, '30b2715f-4dca-4e97-c9d8-05c61ee7336e'::uuid, 4, 'scenario', 'hard', 1, 'Which chart communicates comparison rankings across six product defect causes clearest?', '', '["3D tilted pie chart","Sorted horizontal bar chart with single accent color and direct numeric values","Nested paragraph text"]'::jsonb, 1, '{}'::jsonb, 'Sorted horizontal bars leverage instant visual length accuracy with zero pie distortion.'),
  ('028f31ce-8811-248c-16f1-319bf30e8cce'::uuid, '7aead099-55bf-8126-d76c-8f3e8cfdb251'::uuid, 1, 'multiple_choice', 'medium', 1, 'What belongs inside a strong blameless incident post-mortem?', '', '["Naming which employee forgot a click","Quantified impact, clean timeline, systemic workflow gaps, and dated preventive safeguard owners","Hiding minor delays"]'::jsonb, 1, '{}'::jsonb, 'Blameless analysis focuses on fixing weak workflows rather than shaming individuals.'),
  ('e75a2742-f2e6-5040-46e7-783e4fc0c9f0'::uuid, '7aead099-55bf-8126-d76c-8f3e8cfdb251'::uuid, 2, 'scenario', 'medium', 1, 'In feasibility reports, when should evaluation criteria and weights be locked?', '', '["After reading vendor proposals to match favorite picks","Before scoring options so comparison stays transparent and resistant to confirmation bias","Never specify weights"]'::jsonb, 1, '{}'::jsonb, 'Pre-locked weighted criteria protect fairness across competing business options.'),
  ('87077d3d-aac6-2675-10d0-eca1cd45409c'::uuid, '7aead099-55bf-8126-d76c-8f3e8cfdb251'::uuid, 3, 'multiple_choice', 'medium', 1, 'Which rule governs drafting a reliable Executive Summary?', '', '["Write it before running any analysis","Draft strictly LAST and ensure zero fresh unsupported claims or numbers appear outside body sections","Tease findings vaguely without numbers"]'::jsonb, 1, '{}'::jsonb, 'Executive summaries summarize verified body findings cleanly without introducing orphaned stats.'),
  ('78ad3759-c67c-37e8-3ca3-7294af9e98bb'::uuid, '7aead099-55bf-8126-d76c-8f3e8cfdb251'::uuid, 4, 'scenario', 'hard', 1, 'How should analysts handle percentages summing to 99.9% or 100.1% due to independent rounding?', '', '["Adjust one row secretly by hand","Display exact rounded figures alongside a brief transparent footnote explaining rounding","Remove total rows"]'::jsonb, 1, '{}'::jsonb, 'Honest footnotes preserve mathematical audit accuracy cleanly.'),
  ('fafc6596-2f98-7203-98aa-0fdbf9d485d2'::uuid, '7aead099-55bf-8126-d76c-8f3e8cfdb251'::uuid, 5, 'multiple_choice', 'hard', 1, 'What maximizes the chance a finished analytical report triggers actual change?', '', '["Sending the PDF 5 minutes before a call without notes","Sending early with a crisp decision cover brief and locking accepted Recommendation owners during review","Writing longer appendices"]'::jsonb, 1, '{}'::jsonb, 'Focused pre-reads plus tracked decision sign-offs drive real execution.'),
  ('a1781321-9843-3a43-ff52-b398fc5cb229'::uuid, 'f3eeb4b8-8d01-5376-c07f-0db2803d16e6'::uuid, 1, 'multiple_choice', 'medium', 1, 'What belongs in an email subject line for fast mobile triage?', '', '["\"Quick update\" without project details","Urgency bracket if timely, specific topic/project noun, and target date within ~40 characters","Entire greeting paragraph"]'::jsonb, 1, '{}'::jsonb, 'Front-loaded specifics let recipients decide priority before even opening the message.'),
  ('3d22ea05-4b62-f904-c889-24089bdbdb4e'::uuid, 'f3eeb4b8-8d01-5376-c07f-0db2803d16e6'::uuid, 2, 'scenario', 'medium', 1, 'When asking three separate questions inside a workplace email, which formatting yields fastest full answers?', '', '["Blending all three questions smoothly into one prose paragraph","Numbering questions cleanly `1, 2, 3` with white space","Putting them inside a footnote"]'::jsonb, 1, '{}'::jsonb, 'Numbered standalone prompts keep respondents from accidentally skipping items 1 and 2.'),
  ('9d5d388b-2374-5e13-c968-ab03415d807e'::uuid, 'f3eeb4b8-8d01-5376-c07f-0db2803d16e6'::uuid, 3, 'multiple_choice', 'medium', 1, 'How should you manage a hot, emotionally frustrating email thread?', '', '["Reply instantaneously while frustrated to sound decisive","Draft calmly offline with empty `To:` fields, validate facts neutrally, or move onto a short voice call","Put twelve managers in `BCC`"]'::jsonb, 1, '{}'::jsonb, 'Drafting safely offline and shifting heated tones onto voice protects relationships permanently.'),
  ('933d16f5-4125-80d5-65c3-265ae4db4d31'::uuid, 'f3eeb4b8-8d01-5376-c07f-0db2803d16e6'::uuid, 4, 'scenario', 'hard', 1, 'What defines proper etiquette between `To:` and `CC:` address fields?', '', '["Put the entire team in `To:`","Place active action-owners/responders strictly in `To:` and passive observers in `CC:`","Use `BCC` covertly on peers"]'::jsonb, 1, '{}'::jsonb, 'Clear field boundaries prevent diffused ownership across shared messages.'),
  ('cc077ac4-53fb-8dba-a6a5-68b9a1b8cab9'::uuid, 'd11284ce-dfb9-2246-33db-2b5c8860421b'::uuid, 1, 'multiple_choice', 'medium', 1, 'What proves essential before hitting Forward on a 15-message internal email chain toward a client?', '', '["Keeping all raw replies intact for authenticity","Inspecting/scrubbing internal banter OR writing a fresh clean summary email without hidden thread baggage","Changing font size"]'::jsonb, 1, '{}'::jsonb, 'Nested reply chains regularly leak candid internal debates outward accidentally.'),
  ('dd4f9d3a-1d91-2a51-5767-b973c3a655c4'::uuid, 'd11284ce-dfb9-2246-33db-2b5c8860421b'::uuid, 2, 'scenario', 'medium', 1, 'Which practice guarantees cold networking outreach feels respectful rather than automated?', '', '["Writing five career-history paragraphs with full resume attached","Referencing one genuine specific work observation under 110 words with an optional low-friction ask","Sending daily bumps"]'::jsonb, 1, '{}'::jsonb, 'Demonstrated homework plus modest time requests earn far warmer replies.'),
  ('9337a818-eb3a-d3b7-848b-1a6ef7b167fb'::uuid, 'd11284ce-dfb9-2246-33db-2b5c8860421b'::uuid, 3, 'multiple_choice', 'medium', 1, 'How do One-Touch support replies cut unnecessary back-and-forth emails?', '', '["Saying \"Check FAQ\" concisely","Validating impact warmly, giving numbered clicks, plus providing a proactive Plan B fallback right away","Asking one basic diagnostic question at a time"]'::jsonb, 1, '{}'::jsonb, 'Anticipating likely follow-up roadblocks resolves cases cleanly in one round.'),
  ('435b24e3-c462-432f-f639-7bf526986301'::uuid, 'd11284ce-dfb9-2246-33db-2b5c8860421b'::uuid, 4, 'scenario', 'hard', 1, 'Which technical habit completely prevents hitting Send mid-draft or omitting an attachment?', '', '["Increasing monitor brightness","Leaving the `To:` line blank until proofreading, links, and attachments pass final verification","Skipping greeting lines"]'::jsonb, 1, '{}'::jsonb, 'Empty address lines act as an unbreakable mechanical safety lock.'),
  ('3e5c3ede-1b66-5d45-e3d0-f79eb015d2aa'::uuid, 'd11284ce-dfb9-2246-33db-2b5c8860421b'::uuid, 5, 'multiple_choice', 'hard', 1, 'Why drop heavy graphic banners inside routine email signatures?', '', '["They look colorful","Signature images inflate thread weight and frequently masquerade as fake attachments hiding real files","Plain text cannot align right"]'::jsonb, 1, '{}'::jsonb, 'Clean 3–4 line plain signatures remain crisp across every mobile and desktop client.'),
  ('dea91b42-cba4-164f-2f3b-0cb646878337'::uuid, '3e8432f5-5c26-367e-b092-67a2c3667944'::uuid, 1, 'multiple_choice', 'medium', 1, 'What guides high-retention blog topic selection far better than personal diary musings?', '', '["Breaking unrelated daily headlines","Solving recurring reader workflow struggles inside 3–4 clear editorial pillars","Publishing strictly short updates"]'::jsonb, 1, '{}'::jsonb, 'Consistent thematic utility trains visitors cleanly into loyal returning readers.'),
  ('740d566b-77e0-0655-62fc-d268bacc52f2'::uuid, '3e8432f5-5c26-367e-b092-67a2c3667944'::uuid, 2, 'scenario', 'medium', 1, 'What do the three letters in an APP web introduction stand for?', '', '["Always Push Products","Agree (shared pain), Promise (outcome/gain), Preview (what post covers)","Abstract, Proof, Publish"]'::jsonb, 1, '{}'::jsonb, 'Fast APP hooks orient web readers in under 100 words without textbook throat-clearing.'),
  ('f5f9131d-ee2f-d0ee-c443-07da2f3b17b2'::uuid, '3e8432f5-5c26-367e-b092-67a2c3667944'::uuid, 3, 'multiple_choice', 'medium', 1, 'Why include worked real examples or annotated drafts inside educational blog tutorials?', '', '["Increases scrolling distance","Lived craft proof cannot be faked easily and proves real hands-on authority","Eliminates formatting"]'::jsonb, 1, '{}'::jsonb, 'Transparent real examples show readers exactly how principles execute in practice.'),
  ('abf0b03a-cff8-d75d-c2de-e78328c16f14'::uuid, '3e8432f5-5c26-367e-b092-67a2c3667944'::uuid, 4, 'scenario', 'hard', 1, 'Which link anchor phrasing respects usability and accessibility cleanly inside blog prose?', '', '["Click here","Review Baymard’s checkout drop-off study","URL string pasted raw"]'::jsonb, 1, '{}'::jsonb, 'Descriptive link text clarifies target content immediately for every reader.'),
  ('1c4347aa-103b-0a7a-fcdf-c880f0fc16c4'::uuid, '114714df-8c92-fe8e-bb7f-f656d06f3328'::uuid, 1, 'multiple_choice', 'medium', 1, 'When should blogs invite readers toward email subscription without sabotaging retention?', '', '["Instant full-screen modal two seconds after arriving","Contextually during or after high-value reads via aligned checklists or templates","Only in footer copyright text"]'::jsonb, 1, '{}'::jsonb, 'Delivering helpful proof before inviting deeper opt-ins yields loyal long-term subscribers.'),
  ('0db843c7-40e0-5c56-7048-f725655c246c'::uuid, '114714df-8c92-fe8e-bb7f-f656d06f3328'::uuid, 2, 'scenario', 'medium', 1, 'How do thoughtful bloggers promote new guides across social channels without feeling spammy?', '', '["Dropping raw headline + link repeatedly","Sharing standalone actionable insights right inside native posts with full guide links offered gently below","Tagging twenty unrelated influencers"]'::jsonb, 1, '{}'::jsonb, 'Providing real value natively respects feeds and earns far stronger click interest.'),
  ('8680e33b-056c-5ba1-dc46-3dc20f497756'::uuid, '114714df-8c92-fe8e-bb7f-f656d06f3328'::uuid, 3, 'multiple_choice', 'medium', 1, 'Which publishing cadence drives healthiest 12-month growth for solo or small teams?', '', '["Forcing rushed daily shallow notes until burnout","A sustainable rhythm prioritizing thorough evergreen guides and holding buffer drafts","Random annual bursts"]'::jsonb, 1, '{}'::jsonb, 'Steady sustainable depth compounds search and audience goodwill without exhaustion.'),
  ('c8698228-5649-e2dd-bfdf-7772af8360ac'::uuid, '114714df-8c92-fe8e-bb7f-f656d06f3328'::uuid, 4, 'scenario', 'hard', 1, 'What should editors do when two older shallow posts compete on virtually the exact same question?', '', '["Keep pasting duplicated sentences","Consolidate and enrich them into one authoritative updated cornerstone article","Leave dead links untouched"]'::jsonb, 1, '{}'::jsonb, 'Merging fragmented pieces creates stronger comprehensive utility for readers.'),
  ('a557eeb8-9a07-3c44-bcbe-4e791fba65c4'::uuid, '114714df-8c92-fe8e-bb7f-f656d06f3328'::uuid, 5, 'multiple_choice', 'hard', 1, 'Why pair editorial voice traits with `"Not This"` guardrails (`Confident, not arrogant`)?', '', '["Limits word count","Prevents contributors from pushing tone traits into awkward extremes","Replaces proofreading"]'::jsonb, 1, '{}'::jsonb, 'Clear dual guardrails maintain balanced, recognizable publication voice across posts.'),
  ('c3435707-84c2-37ac-0982-25894c3e66aa'::uuid, '14d06181-5a13-b509-9423-b25e20349aab'::uuid, 1, 'multiple_choice', 'medium', 1, 'Why write spoken script sentences shorter and with natural contractions compared to printed essays?', '', '["Editors prefer short pages","Listeners process audio linearly in real time and formal essay syntax sounds robotic aloud","Microphones clip long words"]'::jsonb, 1, '{}'::jsonb, 'Conversational phrasing allows ears to comprehend smoothly at live speed without rewinding.'),
  ('e9ad4e86-477c-8ed4-f011-0016cb9b1a94'::uuid, '14d06181-5a13-b509-9423-b25e20349aab'::uuid, 2, 'scenario', 'medium', 1, 'What does "See-Say" balance teach about matching voiceover to video visuals?', '', '["Always read bullet text verbatim off slides","Pair spoken causal meaning/story smoothly with visuals showing concrete action instead of duplicating identically","Remove graphics completely"]'::jsonb, 1, '{}'::jsonb, 'Visuals and audio shine strongest when adding complementary context rather than echoing verbatim.'),
  ('58180c45-2d36-5765-fe9c-0546999afaf4'::uuid, '14d06181-5a13-b509-9423-b25e20349aab'::uuid, 3, 'multiple_choice', 'medium', 1, 'Why strip 12-second logo animations and "Hey guys welcome back" pleasantries off online video openings?', '', '["Logos use wrong colors","First-10-second drop-off spikes unless viewers get instant confirmation of title value","YouTube forbids intros"]'::jsonb, 1, '{}'::jsonb, 'Immediate value hooks respect click intent and preserve initial viewer retention.'),
  ('b2cd64ca-22f7-f380-621b-4a99cb402f6d'::uuid, '14d06181-5a13-b509-9423-b25e20349aab'::uuid, 4, 'scenario', 'hard', 1, 'Approximately how many conversational words fit inside one crisp minute of instructional video narration?', '', '["320–400 words","125–145 spoken words leaving space for natural beats and visual steps","40 words strictly"]'::jsonb, 1, '{}'::jsonb, 'Target ~135 WPM leaves balanced rhythm for emphasis, pauses, and screen reading.'),
  ('697893cc-11f0-30c6-332b-80daa6ba93fe'::uuid, 'aaa64fca-50f6-fb54-ba42-421dfe91ad25'::uuid, 1, 'multiple_choice', 'medium', 1, 'What keeps podcast interviews structured without sounding stiffly memorized?', '', '["Reading complete 40-minute transcripts verbatim","Full scripting strictly on Hook, key Stats, and Close while guiding middle conversation via crisp timed bullets","Entering mics with zero prep"]'::jsonb, 1, '{}'::jsonb, 'Hybrid Beat outlines preserve natural spontaneity alongside crisp pacing.'),
  ('21bfc032-22db-52b7-378d-baac483759e9'::uuid, 'aaa64fca-50f6-fb54-ba42-421dfe91ad25'::uuid, 2, 'scenario', 'medium', 1, 'How do successful 30-second commercials avoid overwhelming viewers?', '', '["Listing all eight pricing tiers briskly","Focusing strictly on ONE concrete buyer pain, crisp ~70-word visual demo, and clear single CTA","Using three hosts talking simultaneously"]'::jsonb, 1, '{}'::jsonb, 'Single-pain clarity sticks cleanly in tight time windows.'),
  ('81fc5298-c57c-5f67-70f5-2be3df95087d'::uuid, 'aaa64fca-50f6-fb54-ba42-421dfe91ad25'::uuid, 3, 'multiple_choice', 'medium', 1, 'When writing software video tutorials, when should advanced menu settings be introduced?', '', '["Full alphabetical sidebar tour first","At the exact realistic project moment where solving a visible goal requires them","Strictly in footer text"]'::jsonb, 1, '{}'::jsonb, 'Just-in-time tool context locks practical capability cleanly into viewer memory.'),
  ('eabf8b1f-5908-99a6-0a4b-7c8e9b6e0466'::uuid, 'aaa64fca-50f6-fb54-ba42-421dfe91ad25'::uuid, 4, 'scenario', 'hard', 1, 'What primary flaw does reading a script aloud with a stopwatch uncover fast?', '', '["Wrong paper size","Tongue-twister phrasing, overestimated runtimes, and spoken lines already duplicated visually","Font spelling issues"]'::jsonb, 1, '{}'::jsonb, 'Table reads catch rhythm friction and visual redundancy ahead of expensive filming.'),
  ('b0baab86-74dd-a844-a208-a6f2e892e633'::uuid, 'aaa64fca-50f6-fb54-ba42-421dfe91ad25'::uuid, 5, 'multiple_choice', 'hard', 1, 'Why verify vertical and feed video scripts still tell a clear story with audio muted?', '', '["Speakers break often","Mobile social feeds frequently autoplay muted—visual hooks and clean captions earn the tap-to-unmute","VO tracks are optional"]'::jsonb, 1, '{}'::jsonb, 'Silent readability doubles retention across mobile scroll environments.'),
  ('25c864a5-bf91-a9e2-8313-a707993ccce6'::uuid, '25478589-af0a-1eeb-c340-74b9bbef1295'::uuid, 1, 'multiple_choice', 'medium', 1, 'What four classification actions structure a practical ROT content inventory audit?', '', '["Write, Edit, Post, Boost","Keep, Update/Refresh, Merge/Redirect, Archive/Prune","Like, Comment, Share, Save"]'::jsonb, 1, '{}'::jsonb, 'ROT analysis channels energy toward updating winners and consolidating redundant clutter.'),
  ('bb9f74c2-e3d7-c6b5-d0df-b70dc291ffd3'::uuid, '25478589-af0a-1eeb-c340-74b9bbef1295'::uuid, 2, 'scenario', 'medium', 1, 'How does the Pillar-Cluster model build clear topical depth?', '', '["Publishing random isolated opinions weekly","Connecting one broad foundational Hub guide bi-directionally with focused Cluster Spoke deep-dives","Repeating identical articles monthly"]'::jsonb, 1, '{}'::jsonb, 'Interlinked hub-and-spoke clusters organize user exploration while proving structured mastery.'),
  ('3f287510-0606-30a5-24c6-7080461d03e4'::uuid, '25478589-af0a-1eeb-c340-74b9bbef1295'::uuid, 3, 'multiple_choice', 'medium', 1, 'Why start content planning from Bottom/Middle-of-Funnel buyer questions when small teams hold limited time?', '', '["Glossary topics are forbidden","Decision comparisons and practical workflow assets serve buyers closest to action cleanly first","They require zero research"]'::jsonb, 1, '{}'::jsonb, 'High-intent assets deliver measurable trust and conversions with modest traffic volume.'),
  ('91c35cfb-5992-ca0b-4687-3c6472ced684'::uuid, '25478589-af0a-1eeb-c340-74b9bbef1295'::uuid, 4, 'scenario', 'hard', 1, 'What prevents expensive 3-round rewrites when assigning articles to writers?', '', '["Doubling deadline penalties","Requiring a sharp 1-page Content Brief agreeing reader stage, unique angle, SME proof, and CTA ahead of writing","Hiring more editors late"]'::jsonb, 1, '{}'::jsonb, 'Shared upfront strategy saves hours of post-draft restructuring.'),
  ('68f9c119-0726-9692-9e41-ebfd5a852f95'::uuid, '0aa02607-f577-090d-c43e-2639338cf50e'::uuid, 1, 'multiple_choice', 'medium', 1, 'What makes 15-minute SME Extraction Interviews beat asking busy domain experts to write full essays?', '', '["Audio deletes grammar errors","Low-friction recorded Q&As pull authentic practitioner stories fast while editors preserve cohesive voice","Eliminates factual review"]'::jsonb, 1, '{}'::jsonb, 'Focused interviewing captures genuine mastery without stalling contributor pipelines.'),
  ('292259f8-9ab8-5139-8099-4bb491f8600b'::uuid, '0aa02607-f577-090d-c43e-2639338cf50e'::uuid, 2, 'scenario', 'medium', 1, 'How does strategic Content Atomization maximize research return cleanly?', '', '["Auto-tweeting bare post URLs endlessly","Adapting verified insights, data charts, and clips natively into standalone assets per channel","Deleting older blogs immediately"]'::jsonb, 1, '{}'::jsonb, 'Deep cornerstone work powers weeks of authentic, high-value multi-channel formats.'),
  ('cdd41b7f-7696-c2f4-1276-07c4489f51d3'::uuid, '0aa02607-f577-090d-c43e-2639338cf50e'::uuid, 3, 'multiple_choice', 'medium', 1, 'Why supplement digital link analytics with self-reported `"How did you hear about us?"` inputs?', '', '["Analytics tools fail constantly","Uncovers dark-social word-of-mouth referrals inside private Slack groups, forwards, and podcasts missed by click tags","Replaces conversion metrics"]'::jsonb, 1, '{}'::jsonb, 'Human feedback exposes private sharing paths that automated URL trackers cannot trace.'),
  ('a5282df2-6ce0-5591-5974-78191b1d9ff6'::uuid, '0aa02607-f577-090d-c43e-2639338cf50e'::uuid, 4, 'scenario', 'hard', 1, 'Which structural discipline supports both visual skimmers and screen-reader accessibility cleanly?', '', '["Using `H4` strictly whenever smaller bold text looks nice","Strict sequential semantic heading nesting (`H1 -> H2 -> H3`) paired with descriptive link phrasing","Embedding headings solely inside PNG banners"]'::jsonb, 1, '{}'::jsonb, 'Semantic heading order guarantees universal navigation clarity across all reading tools.'),
  ('cc873853-aacf-bdfd-8691-7792f2c1db3c'::uuid, '0aa02607-f577-090d-c43e-2639338cf50e'::uuid, 5, 'multiple_choice', 'hard', 1, 'What separates persuasive leadership roadmap pitches from empty editorial wishlists?', '', '["Promises of guaranteed viral hits","Mapping realistic resource needs, ROT consolidation wins, and buyer gaps directly to business KPIs","Long literary style essays"]'::jsonb, 1, '{}'::jsonb, 'Executives back editorial plans clearly anchored in operational economics and realistic execution.'),
  ('850c3403-fc52-d5ae-9003-133cae6c56f7'::uuid, '14f0814d-2798-9ea8-50a3-a86f4aa9ee35'::uuid, 1, 'multiple_choice', 'medium', 1, 'What sequence moves cleanly from big-picture soundness to fine layout polish?', '', '["Proofreading -> Line -> Developmental -> Copy","Developmental -> Line -> Copyediting -> Proofreading","Copyediting -> Proofreading -> Developmental"]'::jsonb, 1, '{}'::jsonb, 'Macro architecture and logic stabilize completely before tuning sentences, uniform style, and final layout.'),
  ('2f116df2-5e69-37f7-362f-1946988f0410'::uuid, '14f0814d-2798-9ea8-50a3-a86f4aa9ee35'::uuid, 2, 'scenario', 'medium', 1, 'What defines an editorial "do no harm" approach toward author voice?', '', '["Replacing casual warmth with bureaucratic stiffness","Clarifying real ambiguity and errors while preserving the writer’s authentic voice and valid style choices","Skipping comments completely"]'::jsonb, 1, '{}'::jsonb, 'Great editors elevate clarity while leaving the writer sounding unmistakably themselves.'),
  ('bc3143bd-7713-0150-5c9c-d42eba991a51'::uuid, '14f0814d-2798-9ea8-50a3-a86f4aa9ee35'::uuid, 3, 'multiple_choice', 'medium', 1, 'Which sentence avoids a dangling modifier properly?', '', '["Evaluating the draft carefully, three weak citations popped up.","Evaluating the draft carefully, Elena spotted three weak citations.","Three weak citations were evaluating the draft."]'::jsonb, 1, '{}'::jsonb, 'The true agent doing the action (`Elena`) sits immediately after the opening phrase.'),
  ('4c0c8514-a6de-9a8f-84a2-37be36cb0c15'::uuid, '14f0814d-2798-9ea8-50a3-a86f4aa9ee35'::uuid, 4, 'scenario', 'hard', 1, 'Why build a living 1-page Style Sheet on longer writing/editing projects?', '', '["Lists author salaries","Locks consistent choices across valid spelling variants (`12%` vs `12 percent`), casing, and hyphenation","Replaces thesis checks"]'::jsonb, 1, '{}'::jsonb, 'Style sheets eliminate distracting micro-inconsistencies seamlessly across chapters.'),
  ('f2b05fc3-9af7-054c-277c-730f3980f570'::uuid, 'a79621c3-1044-637a-f473-ec7b2bfe8bf3'::uuid, 1, 'multiple_choice', 'medium', 1, 'Which compound hyphenation rule holds accurately in modern US/UK editing guides?', '', '["Always hyphenate `-ly` adverbs before nouns (`quickly-made`)","Hyphenate unified compound modifiers sitting ahead of a noun (`well-tested plan`), skip hyphens on `-ly` adverbs","Avoid hyphens completely"]'::jsonb, 1, '{}'::jsonb, 'Pre-noun compounds guide clean reading (`short-term goal`), whereas `-ly` adverbs clearly modify cleanly alone.'),
  ('de6dcf6a-595e-d346-e8a9-4884368f7a4d'::uuid, 'a79621c3-1044-637a-f473-ec7b2bfe8bf3'::uuid, 2, 'scenario', 'medium', 1, 'If bounce rate shifts from 40% to 50%, how do disciplined copyeditors express that change cleanly?', '', '["A 10% relative rise strictly","A 10 percentage-point increase (equivalent to a 25% relative rise)","An unmeasurable delta"]'::jsonb, 1, '{}'::jsonb, 'Separating percentage points from relative ratios prevents serious quantitative distortion.'),
  ('168051dd-e712-36ca-8b96-caaba414dc71'::uuid, 'a79621c3-1044-637a-f473-ec7b2bfe8bf3'::uuid, 3, 'multiple_choice', 'medium', 1, 'Why perform final proofreading in an altered visual format or slowly aloud?', '', '["Printer fonts use less ink","Disrupts brain auto-complete familiarity blindness so dropped words and giant headline typos become visible","Spellcheck demands PDFs"]'::jsonb, 1, '{}'::jsonb, 'Changing medium or speaking aloud forces real letter-by-letter perception.'),
