  ('e320d023-c42a-e035-18f1-615c5fed35e7'::uuid, '79f81745-6f50-966b-ec37-0570fc22ffc0'::uuid, 2, 'scenario', 'medium', 1, 'What major bias distorts findings if pricing polls go ONLY to enthusiastic loyal community newsletter fans?', '', '["Email delivery lags","Selection/Survivorship Bias ignores skeptical cold newcomers and churned leavers who judge offers very differently","Followers type faster"]'::jsonb, 1, '{}'::jsonb, 'Balanced market research separates loyal insider bias clearly from cold target impressions.'),
