3. Specify Motion & Caption Rules (Ease-Out timing specs, UI 9:16 + 16:9 safe zones, readable contrast & proofreading check).
4. Supply your Export Matrix (`sRGB` WebP/JPEG sizing, H.264 MP4 frame-rate/bitrate, clean textless archive) + final 3-pass QA log (or link/upload finished photo/video media directly!).', '"Finished photo/video/storyboard media upload, public link, or complete multi-part production pack."'::jsonb, 'Video/Audio/Image upload, hosted link + production notes, or structured written production brief.', 'Verify real concrete decibel, ease-timing, sRGB, and safe-zone details rather than vague promises.', 25, 18, '["written","file","project_url","screenshot"]'::jsonb, '["application/pdf","image/png","image/jpeg","image/webp","text/plain","text/markdown","text/csv"]'::jsonb, 25, true, '[{"id":"r1","label":"Photography Lighting & Storyboard Coverage","description":"Soft directional light choices, clean edges, exposure logic, and varied 5-shot sequencing.","maxPoints":7,"weightPercent":28},{"id":"r2","label":"Audio Clarity & Video Pacing Craft","description":"Intelligible speech targets, low ducked music, tight radio-cut pacing, and J/L-cut B-roll flow.","maxPoints":6,"weightPercent":24},{"id":"r3","label":"Motion Easing & Safe-Zone Typography","description":"Crisp Ease-Out timing discipline, readable contrast, proofed captions, and UI-safe placement.","maxPoints":6,"weightPercent":24},{"id":"r4","label":"Color Balance, Exports & 3-Pass QA","description":"Neutral-first color match, accurate sRGB/H.264 exports, textless archiving, and final QA rigor.","maxPoints":6,"weightPercent":24}]'::jsonb),
    ('7be6ca6c-4b6a-0c98-a7d2-d3587b499b74', 'web-development', 'web-development-and-git', '6e6984b5-de07-5aa6-de2c-58b18c35080d'::uuid, 'Web Engineering, Git & Coordination Capstone', 'Deliver a semantic responsive single-page feature or layout refactor paired with an atomic Git branch/commit plan, PR verification note, and 5-item QA release sheet.', 'Submit a live repo/project link or structured written package documenting semantic HTML landmarks, mobile-first CSS rules, XSS-safe DOM handling, Git workflow commands, and QA criteria.', '["Semantic HTML/CSS responsive snippet or repo link","Atomic Git branching + PR verification summary","5-row QA & acceptance checklist"]'::jsonb, 'Repository/live link, document upload, or structured engineering summary', 'Include exact viewport checks (375px + desktop) and confirm safe text escaping.', 25, 18, '["written","file","project_url","repo_url","screenshot"]'::jsonb, '["application/pdf","image/png","image/jpeg","image/webp","text/plain","text/markdown","text/csv"]'::jsonb, 25, true, '[{"id":"r1","label":"Semantic HTML & Accessibility","description":"Proper landmarks, ordered headings, visible labels, and native interactive elements.","maxPoints":7,"weightPercent":28},{"id":"r2","label":"Responsive CSS & Safe DOM JS","description":"Mobile-first layout without overflow plus safe escaping/delegation.","maxPoints":6,"weightPercent":24},{"id":"r3","label":"Git Hygiene & PR Discipline","description":"Focused branching, atomic commit messages, and verification notes.","maxPoints":6,"weightPercent":24},{"id":"r4","label":"QA & Tool Coordination","description":"Clear acceptance criteria and reproducible verification sheet.","maxPoints":6,"weightPercent":24}]'::jsonb),
    ('1bfca394-8abf-d1c2-4e94-8ba3bd8f2381', 'backend-development', 'backend-databases-full-stack', '47f4bd68-8321-5ed3-58f6-9225c2a58ddd'::uuid, 'Full-Stack Schema, RLS & API Architecture Capstone', 'Architect and document a complete multi-table feature (Schema + Indexes + RLS + Idempotent Server Mutation + Frontend Repository Contract) covering a realistic workflow.', 'Submit SQL definitions, explicit PostgREST/API query contracts, idempotency & RLS security justifications, and verification test cases.', '["Normalized SQL schema + FK indexes","Least-privilege RLS & SECURITY DEFINER specification","API contract & failure-handling plan"]'::jsonb, 'Repository/architecture link, SQL file upload, or structured engineering spec', 'Verify explicit FK disambiguation, pinned search_path, and negative permission test cases.', 25, 18, '["written","file","repo_url","project_url"]'::jsonb, '["application/pdf","image/png","image/jpeg","image/webp","text/plain","text/markdown","text/csv"]'::jsonb, 25, true, '[{"id":"r1","label":"Relational Schema & Constraints","description":"Normalized keys, junction tables, CHECK constraints, and FK indexes.","maxPoints":7,"weightPercent":28},{"id":"r2","label":"RLS & Auth Boundaries","description":"Least-privilege grants, server-side ownership, and zero hardcoded credentials.","maxPoints":6,"weightPercent":24},{"id":"r3","label":"Concurrency & Validation","description":"Transactions, idempotency keys, parameterized queries, and failure cleanup.","maxPoints":6,"weightPercent":24},{"id":"r4","label":"Full-Stack Parity & Testing","description":"Aligned API shapes and negative/positive Postgres contract tests.","maxPoints":6,"weightPercent":24}]'::jsonb),
    ('3b7fe564-61a6-34ee-3f97-ab5513b25983', 'mobile-app-development', 'mobile-apps-and-software-testing', 'c34da86f-4c2d-c9e8-d463-d916ffc7ed6f'::uuid, 'Mobile UX & Automated Test Suite Capstone', 'Audit a multi-screen mobile user flow for touch ergonomics, offline/error resilience, and accessibility, paired with a complete deterministic test plan covering unit boundaries, integration contracts, and regression checks.', 'Submit a structured mobile ergonomics audit + state-handling spec + 10 concrete test cases (boundary, offline retry, permission/accessibility, and regression lock).', '["4-screen mobile ergonomics & accessibility audit","Offline draft + idempotent sync state design","10-case unit/integration/regression test plan"]'::jsonb, 'Repo link, test specification upload, or structured QA engineering writeup', 'Include exact boundary values, ARIA state checks, and non-flaky timing strategies.', 25, 18, '["written","file","repo_url","screenshot"]'::jsonb, '["application/pdf","image/png","image/jpeg","image/webp","text/plain","text/markdown","text/csv"]'::jsonb, 25, true, '[{"id":"r1","label":"Mobile Ergonomics & Accessibility","description":"Touch targets, safe spacing, CLS prevention, and ARIA state hygiene.","maxPoints":7,"weightPercent":28},{"id":"r2","label":"Offline & Error State Resilience","description":"Loading/Empty/Offline/Error coverage plus draft preservation.","maxPoints":6,"weightPercent":24},{"id":"r3","label":"Unit & Boundary Test Design","description":"Deterministic Arrange-Act-Assert cases hitting real edge thresholds.","maxPoints":6,"weightPercent":24},{"id":"r4","label":"Integration & Regression Strategy","description":"Realistic integration boundaries and zero-flake CI discipline.","maxPoints":6,"weightPercent":24}]'::jsonb),
    ('93684ab6-1e08-f31c-515e-9ff52d75c375', 'cybersecurity', 'cloud-devops-and-cybersecurity', '99cc10e2-42e2-8f08-0335-52c81c8afcdb'::uuid, 'Cloud Security, CI/CD & Incident Triage Capstone', 'Produce a comprehensive security hardening & operational runbook covering OWASP access boundaries, cloud env/storage rules, CI/CD gates, and a two-incident triage playbook.', 'Submit a structured security & DevOps specification addressing access control, secret separation, upload validation, CI checks, rollback steps, and user-safe support triage.', '["Access control & upload security threat model","Environment secret boundary + CI/CD pipeline spec","Two-scenario incident triage & rollback runbook"]'::jsonb, 'Repo/runbook link, PDF/Markdown upload, or structured engineering audit', 'Include concrete checks showing RLS enforcement, private bucket rules, and zero-secret client boundaries.', 25, 18, '["written","file","repo_url","project_url"]'::jsonb, '["application/pdf","image/png","image/jpeg","image/webp","text/plain","text/markdown","text/csv"]'::jsonb, 25, true, '[{"id":"r1","label":"Access Control & OWASP Hardening","description":"Clear server-derived identity, RLS, injection, and upload protections.","maxPoints":7,"weightPercent":28},{"id":"r2","label":"Cloud & Secrets Hygiene","description":"Strict client/server env separation, private storage quotas, and headers.","maxPoints":6,"weightPercent":24},{"id":"r3","label":"CI/CD & Rollback Readiness","description":"Deterministic CI checks, lockfile hygiene, and safe rollback plans.","maxPoints":6,"weightPercent":24},{"id":"r4","label":"Incident Triage & Support Clarity","description":"Systematic fault isolation and user-safe diagnostic communication.","maxPoints":6,"weightPercent":24}]'::jsonb),
    ('d71a6689-d3fe-e46d-7887-3c8b764fa883', 'data-analysis', 'data-analysis-ai-machine-learning', '43b56bc5-2a1f-1b7d-c148-be0d371dc000'::uuid, 'Data Analysis, AI & ML Evaluation Capstone', 'Audit a messy dataset, frame a clean analytical or ML decision question free of leakage/bias, design a grounded AI workflow prompt with verification checks, and summarize insights with honest metrics.', 'Submit a structured analysis & AI governance deliverable covering data cleaning, cohort/metric choice, leakage prevention, prompt grounding, and executive recommendation.', '["Data hygiene & bias audit log","Decision metric / ML framing & leakage check","Grounded AI prompt + human verification brief"]'::jsonb, 'Spreadsheet/notebook link, document upload, or structured analytical report', 'Verify join deduplication, median vs mean reasoning, and train/test leakage checks.', 25, 18, '["written","file","project_url","repo_url"]'::jsonb, '["application/pdf","image/png","image/jpeg","image/webp","text/plain","text/markdown","text/csv"]'::jsonb, 25, true, '[{"id":"r1","label":"Data Hygiene & Bias Audit","description":"Identifies duplicates, join inflation, skew, and survivorship bias accurately.","maxPoints":7,"weightPercent":28},{"id":"r2","label":"Analytical & ML Framing","description":"Sound metric selection, baseline heuristic, and strict leakage prevention.","maxPoints":6,"weightPercent":24},{"id":"r3","label":"Grounded AI & Safety Controls","description":"Structured prompt, abstention rules, privacy redaction, and human verification.","maxPoints":6,"weightPercent":24},{"id":"r4","label":"Visual & Decision Clarity","description":"Honest visual framing, clear sample caveats, and actionable recommendation.","maxPoints":6,"weightPercent":24}]'::jsonb),
    ('c9b57e88-887c-f140-a60e-78662455d414', 'cv-and-resume-writing', 'cv-interviews-and-portfolio', '5c092ee8-8a8e-3ab6-0495-6868e470d4d2'::uuid, 'Career Proof, Interview & 90-Day Roadmap Capstone', 'Assemble a cohesive job-readiness package combining an outcome-rewritten CV summary + 5 bullets, 1 structured portfolio case study outline, 2 STAR interview stories, and a 90-day skill & outreach plan.', 'Submit a live portfolio/document link or structured written package clearly connecting target role requirements to concrete evidence.', '["5 rewritten impact CV bullets","1 Problem-Process-Outcome portfolio case study","2 STAR stories + 90-day action plan"]'::jsonb, 'Portfolio URL, PDF/DOCX CV upload, or structured written career dossier', 'Verify all links work in incognito and keep "I" actions distinct in STAR stories.', 25, 18, '["written","file","project_url"]'::jsonb, '["application/pdf","image/png","image/jpeg","image/webp","text/plain","text/markdown","text/csv"]'::jsonb, 25, true, '[{"id":"r1","label":"Outcome-Based CV Craft","description":"Specific action verbs, honest measurable scope, and clean hierarchy.","maxPoints":7,"weightPercent":28},{"id":"r2","label":"Portfolio Evidence & Clarity","description":"Clear problem, individual contribution, process trade-offs, and working proof.","maxPoints":6,"weightPercent":24},{"id":"r3","label":"STAR Interview Readiness","description":"Tight pacing, clear ownership, and realistic recovery/trade-off depth.","maxPoints":6,"weightPercent":24},{"id":"r4","label":"Target Roadmap & Outreach","description":"Realistic gap mapping, concise value-first outreach, and 90-day plan.","maxPoints":6,"weightPercent":24}]'::jsonb),
    ('ddf58369-ac88-a8e7-a61a-da758f8f0cdc', 'remote-work-skills', 'remote-work-time-and-productivity', 'a2ae3f9c-49f6-5f99-edf5-171806df104b'::uuid, 'Remote Execution, Async Clarity & Productivity Capstone', 'Produce an integrated remote operations toolkit: 3 rewritten async messages, an early-blocker escalation note, a 5-day time-blocked schedule with shutdown ritual, and a 1-page team workflow proposal.', 'Submit a clear document or structured written package proving async clarity, realistic capacity planning, and calm workplace professionalism.', '["3 complete async messages + post-call summary template","Blocker escalation + feedback response scripts","5-day time-blocked calendar & shutdown plan"]'::jsonb, 'Document upload, workspace link, or structured written operations pack', 'Keep messages concise (<5 lines where possible) with explicit links, options, and timezone notes.', 25, 18, '["written","file","project_url"]'::jsonb, '["application/pdf","image/png","image/jpeg","image/webp","text/plain","text/markdown","text/csv"]'::jsonb, 25, true, '[{"id":"r1","label":"Async Communication Craft","description":"Self-contained context, links, options, and public channel discipline.","maxPoints":7,"weightPercent":28},{"id":"r2","label":"Professionalism & Accountability","description":"Calm early risk escalation and ego-free feedback handling.","maxPoints":6,"weightPercent":24},{"id":"r3","label":"Time & Productivity Architecture","description":"Protected deep blocks, batched shallow tasks, and single-system review.","maxPoints":6,"weightPercent":24},{"id":"r4","label":"Sustainable Boundaries & Initiative","description":"Clean shutdown ritual, agenda discipline, and starter workflow pitch.","maxPoints":6,"weightPercent":24}]'::jsonb),
    ('a908cfdb-6514-162e-a41e-856014ea4b74', 'freelancing', 'freelancing-clients-and-personal-finance', 'a1596dc2-a427-e2ed-0598-e60c9df66bc7'::uuid, 'Freelancing, Client & Cash-Flow Mastery Capstone', 'Create a complete independent practice pack: a 1-page milestone SOW proposal, a scope-creep pivot script, a weekly client memo, a testimonial/referral ask, and a variable-income cash-flow budget.', 'Submit a structured document or link covering deliverables/exclusions, deposit terms, calm client communication, and tax/emergency reserve allocations.', '["1-page SOW with exclusions & 50/50 terms","Scope-creep options email + Friday client memo","Variable-income cash-flow & tax-vault budget"]'::jsonb, 'Spreadsheet/document link, PDF upload, or structured freelance playbook', 'Ensure tax reserves, revision limits, and client feedback SLAs are stated explicitly.', 25, 18, '["written","file","project_url"]'::jsonb, '["application/pdf","image/png","image/jpeg","image/webp","text/plain","text/markdown","text/csv"]'::jsonb, 25, true, '[{"id":"r1","label":"Proposal & Scope Protection","description":"Measurable deliverables, revision caps, exclusions, and deposit structure.","maxPoints":7,"weightPercent":28},{"id":"r2","label":"Client Management Clarity","description":"Proactive Friday check-in and warm option-based scope pivot.","maxPoints":6,"weightPercent":24},{"id":"r3","label":"Networking & Referral Craft","description":"Genuine double-opt-in/keep-warm habits and peak-moment review prompts.","maxPoints":6,"weightPercent":24},{"id":"r4","label":"Personal Finance & Cash Flow","description":"Realistic essentials baseline, sinking funds, tax vault, and buffer math.","maxPoints":6,"weightPercent":24}]'::jsonb)
) as v(id, skill_slug, course_slug, phase_uuid, title, brief, instructions, expected_deliverables, submission_format, deliverable_hint, max_score, passing_score, allowed_evidence_types, allowed_mime_types, max_file_size_mb, is_required, rubric)
join public.skills sk on sk.slug = v.skill_slug
left join public.courses co on co.slug = v.course_slug
left join public.phases ph on ph.id = v.phase_uuid
on conflict (id) do update set
  skill_id = excluded.skill_id,
  course_id = excluded.course_id,
  phase_id = excluded.phase_id,
  title = excluded.title,
  brief = excluded.brief,
  instructions = excluded.instructions,
  expected_deliverables = excluded.expected_deliverables,
  submission_format = excluded.submission_format,
  deliverable_hint = excluded.deliverable_hint,
  max_score = excluded.max_score,
  passing_score = excluded.passing_score,
  allowed_evidence_types = excluded.allowed_evidence_types,
  allowed_mime_types = excluded.allowed_mime_types,
  max_file_size_mb = excluded.max_file_size_mb,
  is_required = excluded.is_required,
  rubric = excluded.rubric;

-- 13. Publish Verified Courses (63)
update public.courses
set publication_status = 'published',
    updated_at = now()
where slug in (
  'frontend-development-foundations', 'graphic-design-foundations', 'digital-marketing-foundations', 'communication-and-public-speaking', 'effective-communication-foundations', 'business-communication-essentials', 'professional-workplace-communication', 'negotiation-skills-deal-craft', 'ethical-persuasion-stakeholder-influence', 'active-listening-diagnostic-inquiry', 'workplace-conflict-resolution-mediation', 'emotional-intelligence-in-teams', 'collaborative-leadership-teamwork', 'structured-critical-thinking-reasoning', 'root-cause-problem-solving', 'slide-visual-presentation-skills', 'authentic-networking-relationship-building', 'general-writing-foundations', 'professional-writing-essentials', 'business-writing-bluf-mastery', 'creative-writing-foundations', 'storytelling-narrative-craft', 'copywriting-conversion-craft', 'technical-writing-documentation', 'academic-writing-evidence-synthesis', 'report-writing-analytical-briefs', 'email-writing-workplace-outcomes', 'blogging-editorial-publishing', 'scriptwriting-audio-video', 'content-strategy-editorial-systems', 'editing-proofreading-standards', 'seo-writing-search-intent', 'entrepreneurship-foundations', 'business-development-partnerships', 'business-planning-operating-models', 'startup-fundamentals-mvp-traction', 'business-model-development-economics', 'market-research-customer-validation', 'financial-literacy-cashflow-margins', 'small-business-management-operations', 'sales-fundamentals-consultative-closing', 'customer-relationship-management-retention', 'branding-positioning-identity', 'product-management-specs-launches', 'project-management-delivery', 'strategic-thinking-decision-making', 'business-negotiation-dealmaking', 'social-media-community-growth', 'paid-social-meta-ads-mastery', 'search-marketing-google-ads-sem', 'email-content-lead-generation', 'marketing-analytics-cro-strategy', 'ui-ux-digital-product-design', 'canva-and-brand-identity-design', 'photography-video-motion-production', 'web-development-and-git', 'backend-databases-full-stack', 'mobile-apps-and-software-testing', 'cloud-devops-and-cybersecurity', 'data-analysis-ai-machine-learning', 'cv-interviews-and-portfolio', 'remote-work-time-and-productivity', 'freelancing-clients-and-personal-finance'
)
